<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy · Cain & Co." %>
<% content_for :description, "How Cain & Co. collects, uses, and retains information on this site." %>

<section class="border-b border-neutral-800">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-5 py-20 max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-neutral-400 mb-4">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-400">
      Last updated <%= @last_updated.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 space-y-10 text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed
                [&_h2]:text-white [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:tracking-tight [&_h2]:mb-3
                [&_p]:mb-4 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:space-y-2 [&_li]:marker:text-neutral-600
                [&_a]:text-white [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-4">

      <section>
        <p>
          This site is operated by <strong class="text-white">2100 Enterprises, LLC</strong>
          (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us&rdquo;), which does business as Cain &amp; Co. This policy
          explains what information we collect through this website, why we collect it, and how
          long we keep it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information only when you choose to give it to us:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Merchandise orders.</strong> When you buy something, we
            store your name, email address, and shipping address so we can fulfill and ship the
            order, along with a reference to the corresponding Stripe payment.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Newsletter.</strong> If you subscribe, we store your email
            address, the date you confirmed it, and a record of which newsletters we sent you.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Push notifications.</strong> If you enable them, we store
            the notification endpoint your browser issues, the associated encryption keys, and
            your browser's user-agent string.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Shopping cart.</strong> We store a random cart token in a
            cookie so your cart survives page loads. It is not tied to your identity.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-white">Site administrators.</strong> Accounts used to manage this
            site store an email address, a hashed password, and the IP address and user-agent of
            each sign-in. These are not fan-facing accounts.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell your information. Apart from the optional advertising measurement
          described below, we do not share it with third parties for their own marketing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Advertising measurement (Meta Pixel)</h2>
        <p>
          If you click &ldquo;Accept&rdquo; on the cookie banner, we load the Meta Pixel from
          Meta Platforms, Inc. It sets a cookie (<code>_fbp</code>) in your browser and sends
          Meta the pages you view, your IP address, and your browser details so we can measure
          and target our advertising on Facebook and Instagram. Meta handles that data under
          <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">its own privacy policy</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          The pixel does not load unless you accept. If you decline, nothing is sent to Meta. You
          can change your choice at any time with the &ldquo;Cookie choices&rdquo; link in the
          footer.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Payment information</h2>
        <p>
          Payments are processed by <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Stripe</a>.
          Card numbers are submitted directly to Stripe and never reach our servers &mdash; we
          store only Stripe's identifiers for your checkout session and payment, plus the order
          and shipping details described above.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Service providers</h2>
        <p>We rely on a small number of vendors to run this site:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Stripe</strong> &mdash; payment processing.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Mailgun</strong> &mdash; delivery of order confirmations and newsletters.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">DigitalOcean</strong> &mdash; hosting and image storage.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Meta</strong> &mdash; advertising measurement, only if you accept the cookie banner.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Each receives only what it needs to perform its function (Meta only if you opt in). Embedded content from
          YouTube and links to streaming services are governed by those companies' own policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>
          Order records are kept as long as required for tax, accounting, and customer-service
          purposes. Newsletter subscriptions are kept until you unsubscribe; every email we send
          includes a one-click unsubscribe link. Push notification subscriptions are kept until
          you disable notifications or the endpoint expires.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          Depending on where you live &mdash; including under the GDPR in the European Economic
          Area and the UK, and the CCPA/CPRA in California &mdash; you may have the right to
          request access to the personal information we hold about you, ask us to correct or
          delete it, or object to certain processing. We honor these requests regardless of where
          you live.
        </p>
        <p>
          To make a request, email us at
          <a href="mailto:info@2100enterprises.com">info@2100enterprises.com</a>. We do not
          discriminate against anyone for exercising these rights.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
          information from them. If you believe a child has given us information, contact us and
          we will delete it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If we update this policy, we will revise the &ldquo;last updated&rdquo; date above.
          Material changes will be noted on this page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          2100 Enterprises, LLC<br>
          <a href="mailto:info@2100enterprises.com">info@2100enterprises.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
